OL,3,GNEWSAM42 drivers warned of major
OL,4,Aweekend closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are being urged to plan ahead
OL,7,Fbefore a full weekend closure of part
OL,8,Fof the M42, with disruption expected
OL,9,Faround Birmingham Airport, the NEC and
OL,10,FBirmingham International railway
OL,11,Fstation.
OL,13,FThe motorway will be shut in both
OL,14,Fdirections between junctions six and
OL,15,Fnine from 21:00 BST on Friday 18
OL,16,FSeptember until 05:00 on Monday 21
OL,17,FSeptember.
OL,19,FA section of the M6 toll between M6 J3a
OL,20,Fand T1 northbound will also be closed.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
