OL,3,GNEWSAM42 drivers warned of major
OL,4,Aweekend closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe work will allow HS2 contractors to
OL,7,Fcontinue operations on the new
OL,8,Fhigh-speed railway, while National
OL,9,FHighways will also demolish a
OL,10,Fdeteriorating bridge at junction six,
OL,11,FBickenhill interchange.
